<title>FRANCE: Eurotunnel April traffic slightly down.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel April traffic slightly down.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-French channel tunnel operator Eurotunnel SA /Plc gave the following traffic figures for April.</p>
<p>				     April 1997     April 1996  Total 97</p>
<p>Shuttle traffic</p>
<p>     cars			     143,902	 154,522    500,970</p>
<p>     coaches			    5,002	   5,372     12,729</p>
<p>     freight (trucks)		     0	  42,689	    0</p>
<p>     Eurostar passengers	  486,359	  404,661 1,687,009</p>
<p>     Railfreight (tonnes)	 242,213	  178,931   876,271</p>
<p>NOTE - Eurotunnel said there was a decline in passenger cars compared to March of three percent partly because there were fewer weekends.</p>
</text>
